<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 3.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 3.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 3	Sept 2	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.360     236.780     237,040    0.13 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.610     159.635     165.490   -3.55 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.658	46.676	48.410   -3.62 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  370.240     369.880     366.280    1.08 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  196.190     196.395     206.030   -4.78 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.395     142.395     147.886   -3.71 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.667	15.664	14.975    4.62 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  217.210     216.880     230.135   -5.62 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.170     301.200     303.640   -0.81 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.891	 1.890	 1.939   -2.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.559	 1.557	 1.575   -1.02 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
